  "REQ DELETE https://management.example.test/subscriptions/sub-test/resourceGroups/id1%2F%20x/providers/Microsoft.M365SecurityAndCompliance/privateLinkServicesForEDMUpload/id2%2F%20x?api-version=2021-03-25-preview",
